---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactSection from '../components/ContactSection.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | Next Wave Dev" description="Read our Terms of Service.">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] overflow-hidden bg-light-aqua px-5 pb-0 pt-10 text-black md:px-8 md:pt-12">
    <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1289px] px-5 md:px-0">
      
      <!-- MOBILE (< 768px) -->
      <div class="w-full rounded-[10px] bg-gradient-to-b from-light-aqua to-secondary-blue p-6 shadow-md mt-4 md:hidden">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-6 w-full">
          <div class="flex h-[150px] w-[150px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-blue shadow-md mx-auto p-2">
            <h1 class="w-full font-heading text-[18px] sm:text-[20px] font-bold leading-tight text-hero-text text-center drop-shadow-sm [text-shadow:-1px_-1px_0_#D49A1D,_1px_-1px_0_#D49A1D,_-1px_1px_0_#D49A1D,_1px_1px_0_#D49A1D]">
              Terms &<br/>Conditions
            </h1>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 w-full">
            <h2 class="font-roboto text-[22px] font-bold leading-tight text-black break-words">Terms of Service</h2>
            <p class="font-sans text-[15px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-black">Please read these terms and conditions carefully before using our service or interacting with our platform.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- DESKTOP (>= 768px) -->
      <div class="hidden md:flex mx-auto w-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] bg-gradient-to-b from-light-aqua to-secondary-blue shadow-lg">
        <section class="relative flex h-[489px] w-full items-center">
          <div class="absolute left-[47px] top-[19px] z-10 flex h-[390px] w-[390px] items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-blue shadow-lg p-4">
            <h1 class="w-full text-center font-heading text-[42px] lg:text-[48px] font-bold leading-tight text-hero-text drop-shadow-card [text-shadow:-3px_-3px_0_#D49A1D,_3px_-3px_0_#D49A1D,_-3px_3px_0_#D49A1D,_3px_3px_0_#D49A1D]">
              Terms &<br/>Conditions
            </h1>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute left-[470px] flex w-[650px] flex-col gap-4 text-left z-10 pr-8">
            <h2 class="m-0 font-roboto text-[48px] lg:text-[56px] font-bold leading-[1.1] text-black break-words">Terms of Service</h2>
            <p class="m-0 font-sans text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-normal leading-[33px] text-black">Please read these terms and conditions carefully before using our service or interacting with our platform.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Content Block -->
    <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1000px] mt-16 md:mt-24 pb-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white p-8 shadow-md lg:p-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-black">1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-black">By accessing the Next Wave Dev platform or purchasing our services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any part of these terms, you may not access our website or utilize our digital services.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-black">2. Billing & Subscriptions</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-black">Our core services are offered as a recurring monthly subscription. By enrolling in a subscription plan, you authorize Next Wave Dev (via our payment processor, Stripe) to charge your payment method on a recurring monthly basis until cancelled. You may cancel your subscription at any time, effective at the end of your current billing cycle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-black">3. Deliverables & IP Ownership</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-black">Next Wave Dev retains all intellectual property rights to the digital products, code, and designs we create during your engagement until your invoice or subscription payment for that period is paid in full. Upon full payment, intellectual property rights for the finalized deliverables transfer to you, the client.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-black">4. Warranties & Liability</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-black">While we are committed to delivering high-quality, professional code and design, our services are provided "as-is." Next Wave Dev shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use the websites or applications we build.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-black">5. Governing Law</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-black">These Terms shall be governed and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Washington, United States, without regard to its conflict of law provisions. Any dispute arising from these terms will be resolved exclusively in the state and federal courts located in Washington.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact Form -->
    <section class="mx-auto mt-8 w-full max-w-[1125px] relative z-10 mb-12">
       <ContactSection />
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>